--- TEST: RUN-003
--- Area: Error Handling
--- Priority: high
--- Name: R306 Invalid Fiber Run
--- Expect:
---   File returns 1 and exits with an error, runner treats it as success.
--- Runner: expect_fatal_exit = true

fiber f() { yield; };
fiber: task = f();
task.run();
task.run();
task.run(); --- Third run on completed fiber -> Halt (R306)
